      "description": "Resolve imports between the independently indexed repositories of this workspace (Python, TypeScript/JavaScript, Go) by package identity and persist the cross-repository edges with both episodes; re-running after new episodes closes stale edges. Then recompute and persist the links from documents to the code symbols they name. Only repositories the caller may read take part.",
